    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yuda na Tamali",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mmahiku ulolo, Yuda nkuhapukana na akuluvake na anung'unuvake, nkuhwena kuimanga ya ku Adulami unaikala na munu yumo uvanchema Hila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yuda panavele aneko nkumwona mwali yumo wa Chikanaani, nang'e nkunnomba. Mwali aneyo atatake vánchema Shuwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aneyo mwali nkwikuta chitumbo, nkummaleka mwana wachilume nkunchema lina Eli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkwikuta kavila chitumbo, nkummaleka mwana wa chilume nkunchema lina Onani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkwikuta kavila chitumbo nkummaleka mwana yunji wachilume nkunchema lina Shela. Pavelekwejije Shela, mahiku anelo Yuda áikala ku Kezibu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yuda nkuntwalila Eli, mwanawe ntandi, mmahe uvanchema Tamali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Henga Eli, ávele munu atênda lahakalenge pameho panga Yahwe, bahi Yahwe nkummwalala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahi Yuda nkunnyaulila Onani kuchidoni, “Ntwale mmahe wa nkululo ahidîle, kwa kuva nni chulembelewa kutenda uchinga ummalekele nkululo vana.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Henga Onani, ánimala kuva anevo vana vakambekuva vake, bahi Onani kila pachilala na aneyo mmahe, nkuva wahumula uchinga anammelekela nkuluwe vana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yahwe nkwona kuva chitendo anecho chinihakalanga pameho pake, bahi nanang'e nkummwalala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahi Yuda nkunnyaulila Tamali, mmahe wa mwanawe kuchidoni, “Uya kukaya kwa atatako, ukahwenehe kuva nannidi mpaka pambekulumuka mwanangu Shela.” Yuda átangwele uchocho wayopa Shela nanang'e anahwa muchi akuluvake. Bahi Tamali nkuuya kukaya kwa atatake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bada ya kupita vyaka fulani, n'jawe Yuda, mwali wanga Shuwa, nkuhila. Yuda pamalidile kunkutangila nkuuka chalumo na nnyanjawake uvanchema Hila, Mmwadulami, nkuhwena ku Timna kwa vanu vachivacheketa angandolo vake maleha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tamali papilikene kuva nkawake àvele nndila kuhwena ku Timna unavacheketa angandolo vake maleha, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nang'e nkuula dinguwo dyake dya unannidi, nkulivimba inguwo kumeho uchinga anamaikane. Nkuikala pannango wa kuinjilila nchijiji cha Enaimu, chijiji chivêle nndila ihwêna ku Timna. Tamali átendile uchocho ing'anya áwene kuva Shela ànikulumuka, henga nanga pavanantwalidile uchinga ààve ntwave.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yuda pammwene Tamali, nang'e ántenda kahaba, ing'anya Tamali álivimbile inguwo kumeho kwake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bila kummala, Yuda nkummwenela Tamali apala panyenje indila panavele, nkunnyaulila kuchidoni, “ Nangu ngùlembela ngulale na wako.” Tamali nkummuja kuchidoni, “Ùmbening'a chamani nikàlala na wako?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yuda nkunnyaulila kuchidoni, “Nguchinikwing'e umbudi yumo wamwana kuhaloka nnikuwa lyangu.” Tamali nkuchidoni, “Ngùvikile chinu chimbemaîha kuva uchiuning'e aneyo umbudi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yuda nkummuja kuchidoni, “Wako ùlembela nikuvikile chinu ntwani?” Nang'e nkunnyang'ula kuchidoni, “Ning'e pete ivêle na inembo yako na luvoi lwake lwa kuwalila pang'ulo na isimbo yunyakwile.” Bahi Yuda nkumwing'a anevyo vitukutuku vyammalele, nkulala nawe. Tamali nkwikuta chitumbo cha Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anepo Tamali nkuuya kukaya kwake, nkuula aila inguwo yanalivimbile kumeho, nkuwala kavila dinguwo dyake dya unannidi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mmahiku ulolo, Yuda nkuntuma ayula nnyanjawake, Mmwadulami ampelekeje umbudi uchinga agambole vitukutuku vyanannekedile ayula kahaba, henga Hila nnyanjawake nanga panankojije ayula mmahe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hila nkuvauja venedi va ku Enaimu kuchidoni, “Ayula kahaba wa pachinu pakuabudila milungu achiikala pannango wa kuinjilila nchijiji, nnyenje indila àvele kwachi?” Nkunnyang'ula kuchidoni, “Apano akánambiwahi kupwawa kahaba malinga aneyo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahi ayula nnyanjawake nkuuya kwanga Yuda, nkunnyaulila kuchidoni, “Nanga panimmwene! Na venedi va apala vànguhaulidile kuva, pachinu apala pakanambiwahi kupwawa kahaba wa pachinu pakuabudila milungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yuda nkuchidoni, “Nneke aikale navyo uyopa tunahekwa. Nangu nímpelekejijije umbudi, henga wako nanga paunkojije.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bada ya myedi mitatu, munu fulani nkunnyaulila Yuda kuchidoni, “Nkawako Tamali vino àjukile kuva kahaba, na àikwite chitumbo kupitila anewo ukahaba.” Yuda nkuchidoni, “Nnyumye panda munnyoche moto mpaka ahwe!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahi pavachinnyumya panda, Tamali nkuntuma munu kwa nkawake wachidoni, “Mwene vitukutuku avino njo aning'île chitumbo. Vino nìkuyuwa ummale mwene pete aino na luvoi lwake na isimbo aino.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yuda nkuvimala avila vitukutuku, nkuchidoni, “Tamali njo avêle na haki upunda nangu, kwa kuva nikanampele Shela ààve ntwave.” Bahi kutandikila liduva anelyo Yuda nanga panalele kavila na Tamali.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
